& [AuthorityDecision]
  + the current user goal and parent formation permit dependency-contiguous B1 source preservation and SJS analysis
  + neither parent formation nor B0 implementation grants B1 implementation process observation or physical authority
  + no current interface may be selected from ambient availability or historical App Server formation without a new exact source-bound decision
  + maximum current action is preservation input audit constraint threat fold API feasibility and blocking-gap publication
  + process launch filesystem observation live receipt production and every B2-through-B5 effect are absent

& [CurrentInterfaceAudit]
  + current workspace_admission exposes admit_candidate_workspace and revalidate_candidate_workspace with an exact hash-pinned direct read-only Git plan and byte-identical receipt freshness check
  + current SWA-04A carries the complete Phase3A request and prior AdmissionReceipt but truthfully marks them unauthenticated unrefreshed and awaiting physical revalidation
  + current B0 binds the B1 request and record profile strings but intentionally exposes no B1 record constructor runtime carrier or process interface
  + the repository contains historical App Server writer formations but no current B1 artifact-bound executable handshake schema sandbox and carrier signature
  + therefore Phase3A can be reused as one B1 atom but cannot alone satisfy B1 host-interface identity

& [DataDesign]
  + B1PreflightRequest contains inherited immutable inputs plus one HostInterfaceCommission and no ambient defaults
  + HostInterfaceCommission separates executable protocol environment host path sandbox process interruption and resource identities
  + CurrentAdmissionObservation binds the exact Phase3A request prior receipt current receipt and immediate equality result
  + HostHandshakeObservation binds raw-content digests parsed strict fields resource account terminal account and post-handshake executable identity
  + RequestedObservedReconciliation retains requested observed equal refused and independently-unproved distinctions for every host and sandbox claim
  + PreflightRecord can express PreflightEligible ObservationOnly only and never contains a B2 carrier
  + B1Fault records first class field physical-contact consequence resource terminal descendant and B2-blocked state without partial success

